              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala efula yakwa, kimikhula kiekha, lundi ekhuungu yaucha ne khukhwikhupa khunju ng'ene eyo ne kakhali se yasiuukha tawe, sikila yaba yombakhwa khu lwanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
