              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efula yakwa kimikhula kiekha, lundi ekhuungu yauucha ne khukhwikhupa khunju ng'ene eyo, mala yasiukha, ne likwa liayo liaba liboofu lukali!”",
          "type": "text",
